            "value": "<p><em>Applied by <strong>Cold Comfort</strong> to the target.</em></p>\n<hr />\n<p>You touch the target and take a little of whatever was carrying it forward. It must succeed at a Will save against your class DC or take a -1 status penalty to its choice of Speed or saving throws — momentum or resolve — until the end of your next turn. On a critical failure the penalty is -1 to both.</p>"
